# Era 5 of The Quota (year 115, three weeks in April, the clearance; design/eras/era5.md): its seventeen places wired
# as areas on their own plates (plates agent, 2026-10-23; render/places/q5_*.mjs, baked by render/bake_era5.sh).
# Loaded by the shell beside wiring/quota-areas.lwd (ui/app.mjs content=quota). No era 2, 3 or 4 area is touched.
# hud-clock and hud-weather: the hour and the weather the HUD shows here while @meta hud-held holds (var.era == 5,
# content/quota/slice.lwd), read by ui/hudtab.mjs; era 5 is spring, so none of them says frost.
# The clip (e5.clip.stop) plays on Mill Street's plate inside the phone's frame: camera: phone (world/camera.mjs,
# ui/phoneframe.mjs). No figures yet: era 5's cast has no sculpted figures; the speakers show on the talk page.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the wide lens: the town in April
@area q5.tower
name: The churchyard under the phone mast
plate: q5_tower
place: q5_tower
lens: wide
variant: evening
hud-clock: 19:35
hud-weather: April, overcast
spawn: 3 0 2.5
camera: 0.6

